   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FEMINA HIP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den Femina Health Information Project inleddes 1999. Sedan starten    har det blivit en av de mest l&#xe5;ngsiktiga och v&#xe4;lrenommerade massmedia initiativ i Tanzania. Projektet har popul&#xe4;ra &#xe5;terkommande tidningar,  TV talkshow och en interaktiv webbplats, liksom andra                 eng&#xe5;ngskostnader produkter och gemenskap mobilisering h&#xe4;ndelser och   partnerskap activities.It anv&#xe4;nder edutainment s&#xe4;tt att n&#xe5; publiken</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Femina Health Information Project was initiated in 1999. Since    its inception, it has become one of the most well recognised long     term mass media initiatives in Tanzania. The project has popular      recurring magazines, a TV talk show and an interactive website, as    well other one-off products and community mobilisation events &amp;       partnership activities.It uses edutainment approach to reach audience</narrative>
  </description>
